From 184e4d5ac8e883a2f77a8f11a23d192905805931 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:47:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vocab: recognize K2-Horizon's <|ifm|im_end|> as an EOG token

K2-Horizon's GGUF metadata registers tokenizer.ggml.eos_token_id as
<|ifm|endoftext|> (the document-boundary token), but the model's own
chat template ends every assistant turn with a different token,
<|ifm|im_end|>, which the model is actually trained to emit there.
That token matched none of the hardcoded EOG-detection strings in this
list (only the un-prefixed "<|im_end|>" is checked), so it was never
registered as end-of-generation.

Effect in production: every chat completion ran to max_tokens
(finish_reason: "length" on every single request, confirmed live),
since the model had no way to signal it was done. Past the point where
it would have stopped, it kept generating and visibly spiraled into
self-doubting "wait, let me re-check..." loops that hallucinated
digits/characters in otherwise-correct strings -- this explains the
"keeps misspelling directory names" / repeated-prefill behavior
reported from a live opencode session, previously suspected to be a
quantization or MoE-value-routing bug in src/models/k2-horizon.cpp
(both ruled out directly: Q8_0 requantization showed identical
corruption to Q4_K_M, and the MoE value-routing sum in
build_routed_value matches build_moe_ffn's reference pattern exactly).

Verified live via --override-kv tokenizer.ggml.eot_token_id=int:250019
against the deployed model before touching this file: finish_reason
flipped from "length" (300/300 tokens, corrupted) to "stop" (14-22
tokens, byte-correct) on every case in a 5-string test battery
(plain English, digit/hyphen strings, identifiers, word lists, and
the original failing path string). Confirmed again post-fix with a
from-scratch local CPU build against the real deployed GGUF, no
override needed.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet
---
 src/llama-vocab.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/llama-vocab.cpp b/src/llama-vocab.cpp
index 80892e1c9..853e7ba8d 100644
--- a/src/llama-vocab.cpp
+++ b/src/llama-vocab.cpp
@@ -2915,6 +2915,7 @@ void llama_vocab::impl::load(llama_model_loader & ml, const LLM_KV & kv) {
                     || t.first == "<|tool_response>" // gemma4
                     || t.first == "<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>" // deepseek-ocr
                     || t.first == "[e~[" // minimax-m2/m3
+                    || t.first == "<|ifm|im_end|>" // k2-horizon
                ) {
                 special_eog_ids.insert(t.second);
                 if ((attr & LLAMA_TOKEN_ATTR_CONTROL) == 0) {
-- 
